      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Something good\nis coming."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Путешествие, встреча или большая мечта.\nНачните отсчёт до важного.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A trip, a reunion, or a big dream.\nStart counting down to what matters."
